      "$z_0=2\\left(\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\mathrm{i}\\right)=1+\\sqrt{3}\\,\\mathrm{i}$, $z_1=-2$, $z_2=1-\\sqrt{3}\\,\\mathrm{i}$.",
      "<strong>Result: $z\\in\\{1+\\sqrt{3}\\,\\mathrm{i},\\ -2,\\ 1-\\sqrt{3}\\,\\mathrm{i}\\}$</strong> – the vertices of an equilateral triangle on the circle of radius $2$."
