      "$\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\left(\\frac{1}{3}\\right)^n=\\frac{1/3}{1-1/3}=\\frac{1}{2}$ and $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^n=\\frac{1/2}{1-1/2}=1$.",
