      "With the substitution $t=\\ln x$: $\\int_2^{b}\\frac{dx}{x\\ln x}=\\left[\\ln\\ln x\\right]_2^{b}=\\ln\\ln b-\\ln\\ln 2\\to\\infty$.",
      "The integral diverges, so the series diverges too (even though $a_n\\to 0$ and the ratio test gives $q=1$).",
      "<strong>The series diverges.</strong>"
