  "$a_n-{@0}=\\dfrac{{@1}-{@2}({@3})}{n+{@4}}=\\dfrac{{@5}}{n+{@6}}$, teda $|a_n-{@7}|=\\dfrac{{@8}}{n+{@9}}$, čo s rastúcim $n$ klesá. Nerovnosť $\\frac{{@10}}{n+{@11}}\\lt\\frac{1}{{@12}}$ je ekvivalentná s $n+{@13}\\gt {@14}$, teda $n\\gt {@15}$. Najmenšie vyhovujúce $N={@16}$.": "$a_n-{@0}=\\dfrac{{@1}-{@2}({@3})}{n+{@4}}=\\dfrac{{@5}}{n+{@6}}$, so $|a_n-{@7}|=\\dfrac{{@8}}{n+{@9}}$, which decreases as $n$ grows. The inequality $\\frac{{@10}}{n+{@11}}\\lt\\frac{1}{{@12}}$ is equivalent to $n+{@13}\\gt {@14}$, i.e. $n\\gt {@15}$. The smallest suitable $N={@16}$.",
