  "$a_n=\\frac{{@0}}{{@1}^n}$, $\\left|\\dfrac{a_n}{a_{n+1}}\\right|={@2}{@3}\\to {@4}$. Polomer konvergencie je $R={@5}$ (stred radu je $x_0={@6}$).": "$a_n=\\frac{{@0}}{{@1}^n}$, $\\left|\\dfrac{a_n}{a_{n+1}}\\right|={@2}{@3}\\to {@4}$. The radius of convergence is $R={@5}$ (the centre of the series is $x_0={@6}$).",
