  "$f'_x=3x^2-{@0}$, $f'_y={@1}$. Druhé derivácie: $f''_{xx}=6x$, $f''_{xy}=0$, $f''_{yy}={@2}$. V bode $[{@3};\\,{@4}]$: $f''_{xx}={@5}$, $D={@6}\\cdot{@7}-0={@8}$. {@9}": "$f'_x=3x^2-{@0}$, $f'_y={@1}$. Second derivatives: $f''_{xx}=6x$, $f''_{xy}=0$, $f''_{yy}={@2}$. At the point $[{@3};\\,{@4}]$: $f''_{xx}={@5}$, $D={@6}\\cdot{@7}-0={@8}$. {@9}",
  "$f'_x={@0}$, $f'_y={@1}$; v bode $[{@2};\\,{@3}]$: $f'_x={@4}$, $f'_y={@5}$": "$f'_x={@0}$, $f'_y={@1}$; at the point $[{@2};\\,{@3}]$: $f'_x={@4}$, $f'_y={@5}$",
  "$f(x)=\\frac{2}{3}x^{3/2}$, teda $f'(x)=\\sqrt{x}$ a $\\sqrt{1+f'^2(x)}=\\sqrt{1+x}$. $\\ell=\\displaystyle\\int_0^{{@0}}\\sqrt{1+x}\\,dx=\\frac{2}{3}\\left[(1+x)^{3/2}\\right]_0^{{@1}}=\\frac{2}{3}\\left({@2}^{3/2}-1\\right)=\\frac{2}{3}({@3}-1)={@4}$.": "$f(x)=\\frac{2}{3}x^{3/2}$, so $f'(x)=\\sqrt{x}$ and $\\sqrt{1+f'^2(x)}=\\sqrt{1+x}$. $\\ell=\\displaystyle\\int_0^{{@0}}\\sqrt{1+x}\\,dx=\\frac{2}{3}\\left[(1+x)^{3/2}\\right]_0^{{@1}}=\\frac{2}{3}\\left({@2}^{3/2}-1\\right)=\\frac{2}{3}({@3}-1)={@4}$.",
  "$f(x)={@0}\\left(1-\\frac{x^2}{2!}+\\frac{x^4}{4!}-\\cdots\\right)$, koeficient pri $x^{{@1}}$ je ${@2}\\frac{1}{{@3}!}$. Preto $f^{({@4})}(0)={@5}!\\cdot\\left({@6}\\frac{1}{{@7}!}\\right)={@8}$.": "$f(x)={@0}\\left(1-\\frac{x^2}{2!}+\\frac{x^4}{4!}-\\cdots\\right)$, the coefficient of $x^{{@1}}$ is ${@2}\\frac{1}{{@3}!}$. Therefore $f^{({@4})}(0)={@5}!\\cdot\\left({@6}\\frac{1}{{@7}!}\\right)={@8}$.",
  "$f(x)={@0}\\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty}\\frac{{@1}{@2}}{k!}$, koeficient pri $x^{{@3}}$ je {@4}. Keďže koeficient pri $x^n$ je $\\frac{f^{(n)}(0)}{n!}$, platí $f^{({@5})}(0)={@6}!\\cdot {@7}={@8}$.": "$f(x)={@0}\\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty}\\frac{{@1}{@2}}{k!}$, the coefficient of $x^{{@3}}$ is {@4}. Since the coefficient of $x^n$ is $\\frac{f^{(n)}(0)}{n!}$, we get $f^{({@5})}(0)={@6}!\\cdot {@7}={@8}$.",
  "$f({@0},{@1})={@2}+{@3}\\cdot {@4}={@5}$, vrstevnica je $x^2+{@6}y^2={@7}$, teda $\\dfrac{x^2}{{@8}}+\\dfrac{y^2}{{@9}}=1$. Poloos v smere osi $x$ je $\\sqrt{{@10}}={@11}$ (v smere osi $y$ je $\\sqrt{{@12}}$).": "$f({@0},{@1})={@2}+{@3}\\cdot {@4}={@5}$, the level curve is $x^2+{@6}y^2={@7}$, i.e. $\\dfrac{x^2}{{@8}}+\\dfrac{y^2}{{@9}}=1$. The semi-axis in the direction of the $x$-axis is $\\sqrt{{@10}}={@11}$ (in the direction of the $y$-axis it is $\\sqrt{{@12}}$).",
  "$m=\\iiint_V ({@0})\\,dV$. Pre každý člen použijeme Fubiniho vetu, napr. $\\iiint_V x\\,dV=\\frac{{@1}^2}{2}\\cdot {@2}\\cdot {@3}$; spolu $m=\\dfrac{{@4}\\cdot {@5}\\cdot {@6}}{2}\\,({@7})=\\frac{{@8}\\cdot {@9}}{2}={@10}$.": "$m=\\iiint_V ({@0})\\,dV$. For each term we use Fubini's theorem, e.g. $\\iiint_V x\\,dV=\\frac{{@1}^2}{2}\\cdot {@2}\\cdot {@3}$; altogether $m=\\dfrac{{@4}\\cdot {@5}\\cdot {@6}}{2}\\,({@7})=\\frac{{@8}\\cdot {@9}}{2}={@10}$.",
  "$s_{{@0}}={@1}={@2}\\approx {@3}$. Podľa Leibnizovho odhadu sa od súčtu $\\ln 2\\approx 0{@4}693$ líši najviac o $\\frac{1}{{@5}}$.": "$s_{{@0}}={@1}={@2}\\approx {@3}$. By the Leibniz estimate it differs from the sum $\\ln 2\\approx 0{@4}693$ by at most $\\frac{1}{{@5}}$.",
  "$u=\\ln x$, $v'={@0}$, teda $u'=\\frac{1}{x}$, $v=\\frac{x^{{@1}}}{{@2}}$: $\\int {@3}\\ln x\\,dx=\\frac{x^{{@4}}}{{@5}}\\ln x-\\int\\frac{{@6}}{{@7}}\\,dx=\\frac{x^{{@8}}}{{@9}}\\ln x-\\frac{x^{{@10}}}{{@11}}+C$.": "$u=\\ln x$, $v'={@0}$, so $u'=\\frac{1}{x}$, $v=\\frac{x^{{@1}}}{{@2}}$: $\\int {@3}\\ln x\\,dx=\\frac{x^{{@4}}}{{@5}}\\ln x-\\int\\frac{{@6}}{{@7}}\\,dx=\\frac{x^{{@8}}}{{@9}}\\ln x-\\frac{x^{{@10}}}{{@11}}+C$.",
  "$u=x$, $v'=\\cos {@0}x$, teda $u'=1$, $v=\\frac{1}{{@1}}\\sin {@2}x$: $\\int x\\cos {@3}x\\,dx=\\frac{x}{{@4}}\\sin {@5}x-\\frac{1}{{@6}}\\int\\sin {@7}x\\,dx=\\frac{x}{{@8}}\\sin {@9}x+\\frac{1}{{@10}}\\cos {@11}x+C$.": "$u=x$, $v'=\\cos {@0}x$, so $u'=1$, $v=\\frac{1}{{@1}}\\sin {@2}x$: $\\int x\\cos {@3}x\\,dx=\\frac{x}{{@4}}\\sin {@5}x-\\frac{1}{{@6}}\\int\\sin {@7}x\\,dx=\\frac{x}{{@8}}\\sin {@9}x+\\frac{1}{{@10}}\\cos {@11}x+C$.",
  "$u=x$, $v'=\\sin {@0}x$, teda $u'=1$, $v=-\\frac{1}{{@1}}\\cos {@2}x$: $\\int x\\sin {@3}x\\,dx=-\\frac{x}{{@4}}\\cos {@5}x+\\frac{1}{{@6}}\\int\\cos {@7}x\\,dx=-\\frac{x}{{@8}}\\cos {@9}x+\\frac{1}{{@10}}\\sin {@11}x+C$.": "$u=x$, $v'=\\sin {@0}x$, so $u'=1$, $v=-\\frac{1}{{@1}}\\cos {@2}x$: $\\int x\\sin {@3}x\\,dx=-\\frac{x}{{@4}}\\cos {@5}x+\\frac{1}{{@6}}\\int\\cos {@7}x\\,dx=-\\frac{x}{{@8}}\\cos {@9}x+\\frac{1}{{@10}}\\sin {@11}x+C$.",
  "$u=x$, $v'={@0}$, teda $u'=1$, $v=\\frac{1}{{@1}}{@2}$: $\\int x\\,{@3}\\,dx=\\frac{x}{{@4}}{@5}-\\frac{1}{{@6}}\\int {@7}\\,dx=\\frac{x}{{@8}}{@9}-\\frac{1}{{@10}}{@11}+C$.": "$u=x$, $v'={@0}$, so $u'=1$, $v=\\frac{1}{{@1}}{@2}$: $\\int x\\,{@3}\\,dx=\\frac{x}{{@4}}{@5}-\\frac{1}{{@6}}\\int {@7}\\,dx=\\frac{x}{{@8}}{@9}-\\frac{1}{{@10}}{@11}+C$.",
  "$z_0=f({@0},{@1})={@2}$. {@3}. Rovina: $z={@4}$, po úprave $z={@5}$.": "$z_0=f({@0},{@1})={@2}$. {@3}. Plane: $z={@4}$, after simplifying $z={@5}$.",
  "${@0}={@1}\\,\\mathrm{e}^{\\mathrm{i}\\cdot {@2}^\\circ}$, takže rovnica má {@3} {@4} s absolútnou hodnotou $\\sqrt[{@5}]{{@6}}={@7}$ a s argumentmi $\\frac{{@8}^\\circ+k\\cdot 360^\\circ}{{@9}}$, $k=0,\\dots,{@10}$: ${@11}$.": "${@0}={@1}\\,\\mathrm{e}^{\\mathrm{i}\\cdot {@2}^\\circ}$, so the equation has {@3} {@4} with absolute value $\\sqrt[{@5}]{{@6}}={@7}$ and with arguments $\\frac{{@8}^\\circ+k\\cdot 360^\\circ}{{@9}}$, $k=0,\\dots,{@10}$: ${@11}$.",
  "$|R_n(x)|=\\frac{\\mathrm{e}^{\\xi}}{(n+1)!}|x|^{n+1}$ pre $\\xi$ medzi $0$ a $x$. {@0} Chceme ${@1}\\gt {@2}10^{{@3}}$. Pre $n={@4}$ je ľavá strana ${@5}$, pre $n={@6}$ už ${@7}$. Preto $n={@8}$.": "$|R_n(x)|=\\frac{\\mathrm{e}^{\\xi}}{(n+1)!}|x|^{n+1}$ for some $\\xi$ between $0$ and $x$. {@0} We want ${@1}\\gt {@2}10^{{@3}}$. For $n={@4}$ the left-hand side is ${@5}$, for $n={@6}$ it is already ${@7}$. Therefore $n={@8}$.",
  "$|a_n|=\\frac{n}{n+1}\\to 1$, nie je splnená nutná podmienka konvergencie.": "$|a_n|=\\frac{n}{n+1}\\to 1$, the necessary condition for convergence is not satisfied.",
  "$|z|=\\sqrt{(\\operatorname{Re} z)^2+(\\operatorname{Im} z)^2}=\\sqrt{{@0}^2+{@1}^2}=\\sqrt{{@2}}={@3}$.": "$|z|=\\sqrt{(\\operatorname{Re} z)^2+(\\operatorname{Im} z)^2}=\\sqrt{{@0}^2+{@1}^2}=\\sqrt{{@2}}={@3}$.",
  "$|z|=\\sqrt{1+3}=2$ a $\\arg z={@0}^\\circ$. Podľa Moivreovej vety $z^{{@1}}=2^{{@2}}\\bigl(\\cos({@3}^\\circ)+\\mathrm{i}\\sin({@4}^\\circ)\\bigr)={@5}\\cdot({@6})={@7}$, imaginárna časť je $0$. Odpoveď: ${@8};\\ 0$.": "$|z|=\\sqrt{1+3}=2$ and $\\arg z={@0}^\\circ$. By de Moivre's theorem $z^{{@1}}=2^{{@2}}\\bigl(\\cos({@3}^\\circ)+\\mathrm{i}\\sin({@4}^\\circ)\\bigr)={@5}\\cdot({@6})={@7}$, the imaginary part is $0$. Answer: ${@8};\\ 0$.",
  "$|z|=\\sqrt{2}$ a $\\arg z={@0}^\\circ$, teda $z=\\sqrt{2}\\,\\bigl(\\cos({@1}^\\circ)+\\mathrm{i}\\sin({@2}^\\circ)\\bigr)$. Podľa Moivreovej vety $z^{{@3}}=(\\sqrt{2})^{{@4}}\\bigl(\\cos({@5}^\\circ)+\\mathrm{i}\\sin({@6}^\\circ)\\bigr)$, kde $(\\sqrt{2})^{{@7}}={@8}$ a uhol ${@9}^\\circ$ má rovnakú polohu ako ${@10}^\\circ$. Výsledok: $z^{{@11}}={@12}$, odpoveď ${@13};\\ {@14}$.": "$|z|=\\sqrt{2}$ and $\\arg z={@0}^\\circ$, so $z=\\sqrt{2}\\,\\bigl(\\cos({@1}^\\circ)+\\mathrm{i}\\sin({@2}^\\circ)\\bigr)$. By de Moivre's theorem $z^{{@3}}=(\\sqrt{2})^{{@4}}\\bigl(\\cos({@5}^\\circ)+\\mathrm{i}\\sin({@6}^\\circ)\\bigr)$, where $(\\sqrt{2})^{{@7}}={@8}$ and the angle ${@9}^\\circ$ has the same position as ${@10}^\\circ$. Result: $z^{{@11}}={@12}$, answer ${@13};\\ {@14}$.",
  "$|z|=\\sqrt{{@0}^2+{@1}^2}=\\sqrt{{@2}}\\approx {@3}$.": "$|z|=\\sqrt{{@0}^2+{@1}^2}=\\sqrt{{@2}}\\approx {@3}$.",
