  "<span class=\"c-accent\">s<sub>{@0}</sub> = {@1}</span> · ln 2 ≈ {@2} · skutočná chyba {@3} ≤ a<sub>{@4}</sub> = 1/{@5} ≈ {@6}": "<span class=\"c-accent\">s<sub>{@0}</sub> = {@1}</span> · ln 2 ≈ {@2} · actual error {@3} ≤ a<sub>{@4}</sub> = 1/{@5} ≈ {@6}",
